[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "Lesson 39 Don't drop it!",
    "start": 1.51,
    "end": 5.732,
    "zh": "第39课 别摔了它！",
    "zh_hant": "第39課 別摔了它！"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "Listen to the tape then answer this question.",
    "start": 6.953,
    "end": 11.175,
    "zh": "听录音，然后回答这个问题。",
    "zh_hant": "聽錄音，然後回答這個問題。"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "Where does Sam put the vase in the end?",
    "start": 13.376,
    "end": 17.298,
    "zh": "萨姆最后把花瓶放在哪里了？",
    "zh_hant": "薩姆最後把花瓶放在哪裡了？"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "What are you going to do with that vase, Penny?",
    "start": 19.72,
    "end": 22.741,
    "zh": "佩妮，你打算拿那个花瓶做什么？",
    "zh_hant": "佩妮，你打算拿那個花瓶做什麼？"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "I'm going to put it on this table, Sam.",
    "start": 24.022,
    "end": 27.263,
    "zh": "我打算把它放在这张桌子上，萨姆。",
    "zh_hant": "我打算把它放在這張桌子上，薩姆。"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "Don't do that.",
    "start": 28.504,
    "end": 29.925,
    "zh": "别那样做。",
    "zh_hant": "別那樣做。"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "Give it to me.",
    "start": 30.505,
    "end": 31.786,
    "zh": "把它给我。",
    "zh_hant": "把它給我。"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "What are you going to do with it?",
    "start": 32.606,
    "end": 35.147,
    "zh": "你打算拿它做什么？",
    "zh_hant": "你打算拿它做什麼？"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "I'm going to put it here, in front of the window.",
    "start": 36.028,
    "end": 40.21,
    "zh": "我打算把它放在这里，窗户前面。",
    "zh_hant": "我打算把它放在這裡，窗戶前面。"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "Be careful!",
    "start": 41.251,
    "end": 42.612,
    "zh": "小心！",
    "zh_hant": "小心！"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "Don't drop it!",
    "start": 42.753,
    "end": 44.194,
    "zh": "别摔了它！",
    "zh_hant": "別摔了它！"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "Don't put it there, Sam.",
    "start": 45.936,
    "end": 48.078,
    "zh": "别把它放在那里，萨姆。",
    "zh_hant": "別把它放在那裡，薩姆。"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "Put it here, on this shelf.",
    "start": 48.298,
    "end": 51.221,
    "zh": "把它放在这里，这个架子上。",
    "zh_hant": "把它放在這裡，這個架子上。"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "There we are!",
    "start": 52.783,
    "end": 54.144,
    "zh": "好了！",
    "zh_hant": "好了！"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "It's a lovely vase.",
    "start": 54.545,
    "end": 56.807,
    "zh": "这是一个漂亮的花瓶。",
    "zh_hant": "這是一個漂亮的花瓶。"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "Those flowers are lovely, too.",
    "start": 57.028,
    "end": 59.49,
    "zh": "那些花也很漂亮。",
    "zh_hant": "那些花也很漂亮。"
  }
]
